The word is "abc".
The size is the number of characters in word.
The ways is an empty list of whole numbers.
For every spot from 0 to size.
Place 0 into ways.

Set item 0 of ways to 1.
For every finish from 1 to size.
Set item finish of ways to (item (finish minus 1) of ways times 2) modulo 1000000007.
The piece is the slice of word from (finish minus 1) to finish.
The previous is 0 minus 1.
For every back from 0 to finish minus 2.
The otherpiece is the slice of word from back to back plus 1.
If otherpiece matches piece, set previous to back.
If back is finish minus 2 and previous is at least 0, set item finish of ways to (item finish of ways minus item previous of ways) modulo 1000000007.

Show item size of ways minus 1.
